  "body": "<!DOCTYPE html>\n<html>\n<head>\n<title>\nPERiLS_2022 Field Catalog | NCAR EOL</title>\n<meta content=\"width=device-width, initial-scale=1\" name=\"viewport\">\n<link rel=\"stylesheet\" href=\"/ui-assets/application-fcbf0ed18d4571c976438d2a92ceee829a3a9bd8a0a1ec0bd11206a8ed43c069.css\" />\n<link rel=\"stylesheet\" href=\"https://fonts.googleapis.com/css?family=Poppins:400,500,600,700\" />\n<link rel=\"stylesheet\" href=\"/ui-assets/projects/perils_2022-40a83e5dc61b33925b7ff50828dd45f53574a66270bc693449c02a2a8554debe.css\" />\n<script src=\"/ui-assets/application-0d828356e3cb80d53803eb1551a8b5472ef4e7cb2eba6ec4228772b1b267330f.js\"></script>\n\n</head>\n<body>\n<div class=\"project-heading\">\n<div class=\"jumbotron\">\n<div class=\"container-fluid word-wrap\">\n<div class=\"row\"></div>\n<div class=\"col-sm-12\">\n<div class=\"project-heading\">\n<h1>\n<a href=\"/perils_2022\">\nPERiLS_2022 Field Catalog\n</a>\n</h1>\n<h2 class=\"visible-md visible-lg\">Propagation, Evolution and Rotation in Linear Storms 2022</h2>\n</div>\n</div>\n\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n\n<nav class=\"navbar navbar-default\">\n<div id=\"navbar-container\">\n<div class=\"navbar-header\">\n<button class=\"navbar-toggle btn btn-default collapsed pull-left\" data-target=\"#project-navbar\" data-toggle=\"collapse\">\nPERiLS_2022 Menu\n</button>\n</div>\n<div class=\"navbar-collapse collapse\" id=\"project-navbar\">\n<ul class=\"navbar-nav nav\">\n<li class=\"active\"><a href=\"/perils_2022\">Home</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/perils_2022/reports\">Reports</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/perils_2022/status\">Status</a></li>\n<li class=\"dropdown\"><a class=\"dropdown-toggle\" data-toggle=\"dropdown\" href=\"javascript:void(0);\" id=\"dropdown-menu-30\">\nProducts\n<b class=\"caret\"></b>\n</a>\n<ul aria-labelled-by=\"dropdown-menu-30\" class=\"dropdown-menu\" role=\"menu\">\n<li id=\"custom\">\n<a href=\"/perils_2022/advisory\">\nAdvisory\n</a>\n</li>\n<li id=\"custom\">\n<a href=\"/perils_2022/aircraft\">\nAircraft\n</a>\n</li>\n<li id=\"custom\">\n<a href=\"/perils_2022/analysis\">\nAnalysis\n</a>\n</li>\n<li id=\"custom\">\n<a href=\"/perils_2022/lidar\">\nLidar\n</a>\n</li>\n<li id=\"custom\">\n<a href=\"/perils_2022/model\">\nModel\n</a>\n</li>\n<li id=\"custom\">\n<a href=\"/perils_2022/radar\">\nRadar\n</a>\n</li>\n<li id=\"custom\">\n<a href=\"/perils_2022/satellite\">\nSatellite\n</a>\n</li>\n<li id=\"custom\">\n<a href=\"/perils_2022/surface\">\nSurface\n</a>\n</li>\n<li id=\"custom\">\n<a href=\"/perils_2022/upperair\">\nUpper-Air\n</a>\n</li>\n</ul>\n</li>\n<li><a href=\"/perils_2022/missions\">Missions</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/perils_2022/tools\">Tools &amp; Links</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://data.eol.ucar.edu/project/610/datasets?subprojectsIds=\" target=\"_blank\">Data Access <span class='glyphicon glyphicon-new-window'></span></a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/perils_2022/help\">Help</a></li>\n</ul>\n<div class=\"contact-us\">\n<a class=\"btn btn-sm btn-default\" href=\"mailto:catalog@eol.ucar.edu?subject=PERiLS_2022 Catalog\" role=\"button\">\n<span class=\"glyphicon glyphicon-envelope\"></span>\nContact Us\n</a>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</nav>\n\n<div id=\"main\">\n<div class=\"container-fluid\">\n<div class=\"row\">\n<div>\n<div class=\"col-sm-6\">\n<div class=\"visible-sm visible-md visible-lg\">\n<img src=\"/ui-assets/projects/perils2022_front-f09c13800211a06f8e546114d240a23afcfb607e0f0778999a2e9c50f81b4590.jpg\" />\nUniversity of Illinois FARM COW radar imagery of the Quasi-Linear Convective System (QLCS) passing through the PERiLS_2022 multi-Doppler network during PERiLS_2022 IOP3 on 5 June 2022 with the signature of the verified tornado near Petrey, AL. Photo courtesy Karen Kosiba.\n</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"col-sm-6\">\n<h3>Status</h3>\nThe PERiLS_2022 field campaign took place 1 March to 30 April 2022 over the southeastern United States. PERiLS had an extensive network of mobile and fixed instrumentation including radars, profiling systems, surface met stations, and lightning mapping array stations provided observations examining quasi-linear convective system (QLCS) tornadogenesis over the southeastern United States region.\n<p></p>\n<b>\n<a href=\"perils_2022/missions\">PERiLS_2022 Mission Table:</a>\n</b>\nSummary of PERiLS_2022 operations and related products\n<p></p>\n<b>\n<a href=\"perils_2022/reports\">PERiLS_2022 Reports:</a>\n</b>\nList of reports related to project operations\n<p></p>\n<b></b>\n<p></p>\n<b></b>\n<b>\n<a href=\"https://data.eol.ucar.edu/project/610/datasets?subprojectsIds=\">Data Access:</a>\n</b>\nDatasets for this project can be found in the Long Term Data Archive at NCAR/EOL for PERiLS_2022\n<p></p>\n<b>\n<a href=\"http://www.eol.ucar.edu/field_projects/perils\">PERiLS_2022 Web Page at NCAR/EOL:</a>\n</b>\nAll other Data Management related questions\n</div>\n</div>\n\n\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"footer container-fluid\">\n<div class=\"row\">\n<div class=\"col-sm-2 eol-logo\">\n<div class=\"visible-md visible-lg\">\n<a target=\"_blank\" href=\"https://www.eol.ucar.edu/\"><img alt=\"NCAR EOL\" width=\"125\" heigth=\"125\" src=\"/ui-assets/eol-small-logo-a5814375cfe46bc76385226c5d10d451e03f0d1855120c59beb77fed2a0248fc.png\" />\n</a></div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"col-sm-8\">\n<div class=\"col-sm-1\"></div>\n<div class=\"col-sm-3 link-container align-left vertical-line left\">\n<dl>\n<dd class=\"bold\">External Webpages</dd>\n<dd>\n<a href=\"https://www.eol.ucar.edu/projects/perils\">EOL PERiLS</a>\n</dd>\n<dd>\n<a href=\"https://www.eol.ucar.edu/\">EOL</a>\n</dd>\n<dd>\n<a href=\"https://www.eol.ucar.edu/content/project-management-office-pmo\">EOL/PMO</a>\n</dd>\n<dd>\n<a href=\"https://www.eol.ucar.edu/content/data-management-services\">EOL/DMS</a>\n</dd>\n</dl>\n</div>\n<div class=\"col-sm-1\"></div>\n<div class=\"col-sm-3 link-container align-left vertical-line left\">\n<dl>\n<dd class=\"bold\">Catalog Resources</dd>\n<dd>\n<a href=\"/\">Field Catalogs</a>\n</dd>\n<dd>\n<a href=\"/perils_2022/help/user_guide\">Catalog Users Guide</a>\n</dd>\n<dd>\n<a href=\"mailto:catalog@eol.ucar.edu?subject=PERiLS_2022%20Catalog\">Contact Us</a>\n</dd>\n</dl>\n</div>\n<div class=\"col-sm-1\"></div>\n<div class=\"col-sm-3 link-container align-left vertical-line left\">\n<dl>\n<dd class=\"bold\">Social</dd>\n<dd>\n<a href=\"https://www.facebook.com/ncareol\">EOL Facebook</a>\n</dd>\n</dl>\n</div>\n\n</div>\n<div class=\"col-sm-2 nsf-logo\">\n<div class=\"visible-md visible-lg\">\n<a target=\"_blank\" href=\"https://www.nsf.gov/\"><img alt=\"NSF\" class=\"img-responsive\" width=\"100\" height=\"100\" src=\"/ui-assets/nsf-logo-small-cc4c8b6e4d1c272e0aaafdbc0015041f7e1cf5415844eea643e5a9950339b598.png\" />\n</a><div class=\"ncar-ucar-logo\">\n<a target=\"_blank\" href=\"https://www.ucar.edu/\"><img alt=\"NCAR UCAR\" class=\"img-responsive\" width=\"65\" height=\"65\" src=\"/ui-assets/ncar-ucar-logo-small-2f8f4d6538c4801b67b14f0a855eb6da5db54952fca84becb5859bf645f409af.png\" />\n</a></div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n<p></p>\n\n<div class=\"align-center\">\n<p>\n<a target=\"_blank\" href=\"https://www.ucar.edu/terms-of-use\">&copy; 2026 UCAR. All Rights Reserved.\n</a></p>\n<p>\nMuch of the Material found on the Site is based upon work supported by\n<a target=\"_blank\" href=\"https://www.nsf.gov\"><strong>the National Science Foundation</strong>\n</a>.\n<br>\n<a target=\"_blank\" href=\"https://ncar.ucar.edu\"><strong>The National Center for Atmospheric Research</strong>\n</a>is sponsored by\n<a target=\"_blank\" href=\"https://www.nsf.gov\"><strong>the National Science Foundation ('NSF')</strong>\n</a>.\n</p>\n</div>\n</div>\n\n</body>\n</html>\n"
